"[{\"id\":\"e4d0856\",\"elType\":\"section\",\"settings\":{\"animation\":\"fadeIn\"},\"elements\":[{\"id\":\"c48a432\",\"elType\":\"column\",\"settings\":{\"_column_size\":100,\"_inline_size\":null},\"elements\":[{\"id\":\"a7098f0\",\"elType\":\"widget\",\"settings\":{\"html\":\"<div class=\\\"sx-hero-meta\\\"><span class=\\\"sx-hero-eyebrow\\\">Industrial IoT Gateway</span><span class=\\\"sx-hero-sku\\\">SKU: SRT-MGATE-1210</span></div>\"},\"elements\":[],\"widgetType\":\"html\"},{\"id\":\"5bccd9c\",\"elType\":\"widget\",\"settings\":{\"title\":\"SURIOTA MODULE – MODBUS GATEWAY IIOT\",\"header_size\":\"h1\",\"title_color\":\"#3C7D47\",\"_padding\":{\"unit\":\"px\",\"top\":\"15\",\"right\":\"15\",\"bottom\":\"15\",\"left\":\"15\",\"isLinked\":true},\"align\":\"center\"},\"elements\":[],\"widgetType\":\"heading\"}],\"isInner\":false}],\"isInner\":false},{\"id\":\"57292b7\",\"elType\":\"section\",\"settings\":[],\"elements\":[{\"id\":\"c39ffa8\",\"elType\":\"column\",\"settings\":{\"_column_size\":100,\"_inline_size\":null},\"elements\":[{\"id\":\"0b364e4\",\"elType\":\"widget\",\"settings\":{\"html\":\"<div class=\\\"sx-section sx-industries sx-prod-apps\\\">\\n  <div class=\\\"sx-industries-inner\\\">\\n    <span class=\\\"sx-eyebrow\\\">Applications</span>\\n    <h2 class=\\\"sx-industries-title\\\">Where SRT-MGATE-1210 is deployed</h2>\\n    <div class=\\\"sx-chip-row\\\">\\n      <span class=\\\"sx-chip\\\">Manufacturing</span>\\n      <span class=\\\"sx-chip\\\">Oil &amp; Gas</span>\\n      <span class=\\\"sx-chip\\\">Maritime &amp; Shipyard</span>\\n      <span class=\\\"sx-chip\\\">Fabrication</span>\\n      <span class=\\\"sx-chip\\\">Agriculture</span>\\n      <span class=\\\"sx-chip\\\">Water Treatment</span>\\n      <span class=\\\"sx-chip\\\">Smart Building</span>\\n      <span class=\\\"sx-chip\\\">Power &amp; Energy</span>\\n    </div>\\n  </div>\\n</div>\"},\"elements\":[],\"widgetType\":\"html\"},{\"id\":\"cfb6020\",\"elType\":\"widget\",\"settings\":{\"title\":\"Elevate Your Industrial Connectivity with Suriota Modbus Gateway IIoT\",\"header_size\":\"div\",\"align\":\"center\",\"__globals__\":{\"typography_typography\":\"globals/typography?id=secondary\",\"title_color\":\"globals/colors?id=accent\"}},\"elements\":[],\"widgetType\":\"heading\"},{\"id\":\"69edade\",\"elType\":\"widget\",\"settings\":{\"image\":{\"url\":\"https://suriota.com/wp-content/uploads/2025/05/GTWY-SRT-VD-scaled.png\",\"id\":1511,\"size\":\"\",\"alt\":\"\",\"source\":\"library\"}},\"elements\":[],\"widgetType\":\"image\"},{\"id\":\"9ad71a7\",\"elType\":\"widget\",\"settings\":{\"editor\":\"<p><strong>Seamless Integration Between Automation Systems and Modern IoT Ecosystems</strong></p><p>The Suriota Modbus Gateway IIoT is an industrial-standard gateway solution designed to efficiently bridge Modbus-based automation systems with Internet of Things (IoT) ecosystems. This device converts data from industrial assets such as sensors, PLCs, or machinery into modern IoT protocols like MQTT and HTTP. With support for Modbus RTU (RS-485) and Modbus TCP/IP (Wi-Fi/Ethernet), the gateway ensures compatibility between existing industrial infrastructure and IoT cloud platforms (AWS, Azure, etc.) as well as on-premises servers.</p><h3><strong>Key Specifications</strong></h3><ul><li><strong>CPU:</strong> ESPRESSIF dual-core</li><li><strong>Wireless Connectivity:</strong> WiFi 2.4 GHz (802.11 b/g/n), Bluetooth 5.0 (BLE) up to 50m LOS</li><li><strong>Ports:</strong> 2× Isolated RS-485 (up to 32 devices per port), 1× RJ45 Ethernet 10/100 Mbps</li><li><strong>Power:</strong> Dual DC 12-48VDC inputs for redundancy, PoE (IEEE 802.3af/at) option on specific versions</li><li><strong>Communication Protocols:</strong> MQTT (ISO/IEC 20922), HTTP/HTTPS, REST API</li></ul>\"},\"elements\":[],\"widgetType\":\"text-editor\"},{\"id\":\"60b9f62\",\"elType\":\"widget\",\"settings\":{\"html\":\"<section class=\\\"sx-section sx-whyus sx-prod-features\\\">\\n  <div class=\\\"sx-whyus-inner\\\">\\n    <span class=\\\"sx-eyebrow\\\">KEY FEATURES</span>\\n    <h2 class=\\\"sx-whyus-title\\\">Why engineers choose SRT-MGATE-1210</h2>\\n    <div class=\\\"sx-whyus-grid\\\">\\n      <article class=\\\"sx-whyus-card\\\"><div class=\\\"sx-whyus-num\\\">01</div><h3 class=\\\"sx-whyus-h3\\\">Multi-Protocol Bridge</h3><p class=\\\"sx-whyus-desc\\\">Converts <strong>Modbus RTU (RS-485) ↔ Modbus TCP/IP ↔ MQTT ↔ HTTP/REST</strong>. No-code register mapping, JSON/custom topic output.</p></article>\\n      <article class=\\\"sx-whyus-card\\\"><div class=\\\"sx-whyus-num\\\">02</div><h3 class=\\\"sx-whyus-h3\\\">Dual Network Failover</h3><p class=\\\"sx-whyus-desc\\\">WiFi 2.4 GHz (802.11 b/g/n) + Ethernet 10/100 with <strong>auto-failover</strong>. Optional PoE (IEEE 802.3af/at) on select versions.</p></article>\\n      <article class=\\\"sx-whyus-card\\\"><div class=\\\"sx-whyus-num\\\">03</div><h3 class=\\\"sx-whyus-h3\\\">Industrial-Grade Hardware</h3><p class=\\\"sx-whyus-desc\\\"><strong>-40°C to 75°C</strong> operating range, 2kV isolation on RS-485, dual 12-48VDC redundant inputs. Built for harsh environments.</p></article>\\n      <article class=\\\"sx-whyus-card\\\"><div class=\\\"sx-whyus-num\\\">04</div><h3 class=\\\"sx-whyus-h3\\\">Mobile BLE Configuration</h3><p class=\\\"sx-whyus-desc\\\">Configure via <strong>Suriota Config app</strong> (Android/iOS) over BLE 5.0, up to 50m range. No PC, no cables, no Telnet required.</p></article>\\n      <article class=\\\"sx-whyus-card\\\"><div class=\\\"sx-whyus-num\\\">05</div><h3 class=\\\"sx-whyus-h3\\\">Cloud-Agnostic Integration</h3><p class=\\\"sx-whyus-desc\\\">Connects to <strong>AWS IoT, Azure IoT Hub, Google Cloud, ThingsBoard</strong>, and on-premises MQTT brokers. No vendor lock-in.</p></article>\\n      <article class=\\\"sx-whyus-card\\\"><div class=\\\"sx-whyus-num\\\">06</div><h3 class=\\\"sx-whyus-h3\\\">Secure Local Data Logging</h3><p class=\\\"sx-whyus-desc\\\">MicroSD slot for <strong>CSV/JSON local logging</strong> during outages. TLS/SSL encryption and firewall rules ensure end-to-end security.</p></article>\\n    </div>\\n  </div>\\n</section>\"},\"elements\":[],\"widgetType\":\"html\"},{\"id\":\"bbe5422\",\"elType\":\"widget\",\"settings\":{\"html\":\"<div class=\\\"sx-action-group\\\">\\n  <a class=\\\"sx-action-btn sx-action-btn--primary\\\" href=\\\"https://www.tokopedia.com/suriota\\\" target=\\\"_blank\\\" rel=\\\"noopener\\\" aria-label=\\\"Order SRT-MGATE-1210 on Tokopedia\\\">\\n    <svg width=\\\"18\\\" height=\\\"18\\\" viewBox=\\\"0 0 24 24\\\" fill=\\\"none\\\" stroke=\\\"currentColor\\\" stroke-width=\\\"2\\\" stroke-linecap=\\\"round\\\" stroke-linejoin=\\\"round\\\" aria-hidden=\\\"true\\\"><circle cx=\\\"9\\\" cy=\\\"21\\\" r=\\\"1\\\"/><circle cx=\\\"20\\\" cy=\\\"21\\\" r=\\\"1\\\"/><path d=\\\"M1 1h4l2.68 13.39a2 2 0 0 0 2 1.61h9.72a2 2 0 0 0 2-1.61L23 6H6\\\"/></svg>\\n    <span>Order on Tokopedia</span>\\n    <span class=\\\"sx-action-arrow\\\">→</span>\\n  </a>\\n  <a class=\\\"sx-action-btn sx-action-btn--secondary\\\" href=\\\"https://drive.google.com/drive/folders/12XOl4YRrcpPVdAbYFFdjo-ylfev5Z-Lu?usp=sharing\\\" target=\\\"_blank\\\" rel=\\\"noopener\\\" aria-label=\\\"Download SRT-MGATE-1210 datasheet PDF\\\">\\n    <svg width=\\\"18\\\" height=\\\"18\\\" viewBox=\\\"0 0 24 24\\\" fill=\\\"none\\\" stroke=\\\"currentColor\\\" stroke-width=\\\"2\\\" stroke-linecap=\\\"round\\\" stroke-linejoin=\\\"round\\\" aria-hidden=\\\"true\\\"><path d=\\\"M14 2H6a2 2 0 0 0-2 2v16a2 2 0 0 0 2 2h12a2 2 0 0 0 2-2V8z\\\"/><polyline points=\\\"14 2 14 8 20 8\\\"/><line x1=\\\"12\\\" y1=\\\"18\\\" x2=\\\"12\\\" y2=\\\"12\\\"/><polyline points=\\\"9 15 12 18 15 15\\\"/></svg>\\n    <span>Download Datasheet</span>\\n  </a>\\n</div>\"},\"elements\":[],\"widgetType\":\"html\"},{\"id\":\"e0d69f2\",\"elType\":\"widget\",\"settings\":{\"html\":\"<section class=\\\"sx-faq\\\">\\n  <div class=\\\"sx-faq-inner\\\">\\n    <span class=\\\"sx-eyebrow\\\">FAQ</span>\\n    <h2 class=\\\"sx-faq-title\\\">SRT-MGATE-1210 | Frequently Asked Questions</h2>\\n    <details class=\\\"sx-faq-item\\\"><summary>What protocols does the Modbus Gateway support?</summary><div class=\\\"sx-faq-answer\\\">SRT-MGATE-1210 supports Modbus RTU (RS-485), Modbus TCP/IP, MQTT (ISO/IEC 20922), HTTP/HTTPS, and REST API. No-code register mapping lets you transform raw Modbus data into JSON or custom MQTT topics without coding.</div></details>\\n    <details class=\\\"sx-faq-item\\\"><summary>What is the operating temperature range?</summary><div class=\\\"sx-faq-answer\\\">The gateway operates reliably from -40°C to 75°C, with 2kV isolation protection on RS-485 ports. It is designed for harsh industrial environments including outdoor cabinets, manufacturing floors, and maritime installations.</div></details>\\n    <details class=\\\"sx-faq-item\\\"><summary>Does it support offline data buffering?</summary><div class=\\\"sx-faq-answer\\\">Yes. The MicroSD slot enables local data logging (CSV/JSON) during network outages. Data is automatically synced back to your IoT platform once connectivity is restored, ensuring zero data loss.</div></details>\\n    <details class=\\\"sx-faq-item\\\"><summary>How is the gateway configured?</summary><div class=\\\"sx-faq-answer\\\">Configuration is done via the Suriota Config mobile app (Android/iOS) over Bluetooth Low Energy (BLE 5.0, up to 50m range). No PC, no cables, no Telnet. Set up register maps, MQTT credentials, and TLS/SSL certificates from your phone.</div></details>\\n  </div>\\n</section>\\n<script type=\\\"application/ld+json\\\">\\n{\\\"@context\\\":\\\"https://schema.org\\\",\\\"@type\\\":\\\"FAQPage\\\",\\\"mainEntity\\\":[\\n{\\\"@type\\\":\\\"Question\\\",\\\"name\\\":\\\"What protocols does the Modbus Gateway support?\\\",\\\"acceptedAnswer\\\":{\\\"@type\\\":\\\"Answer\\\",\\\"text\\\":\\\"SRT-MGATE-1210 supports Modbus RTU (RS-485), Modbus TCP/IP, MQTT, HTTP/HTTPS, and REST API. No-code register mapping transforms raw Modbus data into JSON or custom MQTT topics.\\\"}},\\n{\\\"@type\\\":\\\"Question\\\",\\\"name\\\":\\\"What is the operating temperature range?\\\",\\\"acceptedAnswer\\\":{\\\"@type\\\":\\\"Answer\\\",\\\"text\\\":\\\"The gateway operates reliably from -40°C to 75°C with 2kV isolation protection on RS-485 ports. Designed for harsh industrial environments.\\\"}},\\n{\\\"@type\\\":\\\"Question\\\",\\\"name\\\":\\\"Does it support offline data buffering?\\\",\\\"acceptedAnswer\\\":{\\\"@type\\\":\\\"Answer\\\",\\\"text\\\":\\\"Yes. The MicroSD slot enables local CSV/JSON logging during network outages. Data syncs automatically when connectivity is restored.\\\"}},\\n{\\\"@type\\\":\\\"Question\\\",\\\"name\\\":\\\"How is the gateway configured?\\\",\\\"acceptedAnswer\\\":{\\\"@type\\\":\\\"Answer\\\",\\\"text\\\":\\\"Configuration is done via the Suriota Config mobile app (Android/iOS) over BLE 5.0. Set up register maps and MQTT credentials from your phone.\\\"}}\\n]}\\n</script>\"},\"elements\":[],\"widgetType\":\"html\"},{\"id\":\"80a6472\",\"elType\":\"widget\",\"settings\":{\"html\":\"<section class=\\\"sx-cta-final\\\" aria-labelledby=\\\"prod-cta-heading\\\">\\n  <div class=\\\"sx-cta-final-inner\\\">\\n    <span class=\\\"sx-cta-eyebrow\\\">Get Started</span>\\n    <h2 id=\\\"prod-cta-heading\\\" class=\\\"sx-cta-final-title\\\">Ready to bridge your industrial assets to IoT?</h2>\\n    <p class=\\\"sx-cta-final-sub\\\">Request a quote, RFQ, or live technical demo. Our engineering team responds within 24 hours with sample register-map configurations for your existing equipment.</p>\\n    <div class=\\\"sx-cta-final-actions\\\">\\n      <a class=\\\"sx-cta-final-btn sx-cta-final-btn--primary\\\" href=\\\"https://suriota.com/contact/\\\">Request Quote <span aria-hidden=\\\"true\\\">→</span></a>\\n      <a class=\\\"sx-cta-final-btn sx-cta-final-btn--wa\\\" href=\\\"https://wa.me/6285835672476?text=Hi%20SURIOTA%2C%20I%27m%2